			"notes": "### Added\n- Team management GUI\n  - Main tab\n  - Invitations tab\n  - Incoming invitations\n  - Outgoing invitations\n- Player name caching in TeamManager#getPlayerName\n\n### Fixed\n- Network handling issues\n- Server-side memory leak\n- Memory leak in NetworkReceiver (cleanup of processed requests every 20 seconds)\n\nMain tab:\n<img width=\"1600\" height=\"900\" alt=\"main_tab\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e37a8130-82e7-43d6-aa8b-d72ac8c187a2\" />\n\nThe main tab with teammates:\n<img width=\"1600\" height=\"900\" alt=\"main_tab_with_teammates\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2aa8b5ca-598c-4104-acb9-093e945b5e21\" />\n\nThe invitations tab:\n<img width=\"1600\" height=\"900\" alt=\"invite_tab\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1dddb5aa-d101-4cea-87c3-e844d1fbd8c4\" />\n\nThe incoming invitations tab:\n<img width=\"1600\" height=\"899\" alt=\"invites_tab_incoming\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eb9ce618-b4b6-4d8e-bf97-98dba5a5f2e9\" />\n\nThe outgoing invitations tab:\n<img width=\"1600\" height=\"899\" alt=\"invites_tab_outgoing\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5587ebc5-25f3-438d-b190-c0af617cfac2\" />"
